          "short": "$\\frac{3}{4}$",
          "worked": "The lowest common denominator is $24$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3}{4}&=\\frac{18}{24}\\\\\\frac{3}{6}&=\\frac{12}{24}\\\\\\frac{3}{8}&=\\frac{9}{24}\\end{align*}$$\nSince $18>12>9$, circle $\\frac{3}{4}$.",
